WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:12.840
Eyebrows shape about 70 percent of your overall impression, so if you've had trouble grooming them yourself, it's best to leave them as they are and let the artist handle it.

2
00:00:13.176 --> 00:00:22.536
A makeup artist doesn't just trim hair, they analyze your facial proportions, bone structure, and muscle movement to find the eyebrow shape that suits you best.

3
00:00:22.872 --> 00:00:28.128
If you trim the arch too much or ruin the shape on your own, there's only so much that can be corrected afterward,

4
00:00:28.464 --> 00:00:33.888
and thin, sharply arched eyebrows in particular risk making you look older and harsher.

5
00:00:34.224 --> 00:00:39.984
When the artist tidies stray hairs into a softer shape that suits the wedding-parent look and brings out the natural grain,

6
00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:45.552
you get a gentler, noticeably younger look without any separate procedure.
